  "prefLabel": "En 902.17 Federal poverty guidelines",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 902.17 “Federal poverty guidelines” means the federal poverty guidelines updated periodically in the federal register by the U.S. department of health and human services under the authority of 42 U.S.C. §9909(2).\n\nSource. #14568, eff 4-27-26, EXPIRES: 4-27-36",
